              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Say plainly that stopping before §6 does not give you an inert box, and — if there is a supported way to stage one — say what it is. If there is not, say that instead. Do not invent a mechanism."
                    }
                  ]
