                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Connect this to §7's KAN-550 paragraph so the incident and its cause sit together. §7's existing text is a sibling task's neighbour, so add a sentence and a pointer rather than rewriting the paragraph."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Generalise §9's already-running warning into a stated rule that covers any daemon-side switch, keeping the channels case as its worked example. §9's specifics — the transport table, the "
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "--dangerously-load-development-channels",
                      "marks": [
