              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Changing any behaviour. Both parts of this ticket are documentation. If you find that the code should change — for example that there ought to be a real way to stage an inert box — file a ticket and link it "
